@layout('layouts/app')

@section('content')
<style>
  /* ── Hero ── */
  .hero {
    padding: 28px 0 32px;
  }
  .hero-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: var(--accent-light);
    border: 1px solid rgba(56,189,248,.25);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .hero h1 span {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #818cf8);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }
  .hero p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ── Transcript panel ── */
  .transcript-panel {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .transcript-toolbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .transcript-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .toolbar-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .tool-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: inherit;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
    color: var(--muted);
    transition: background .15s, color .15s, border-color .15s;
  }
  .tool-btn:hover { background: var(--surface-3); color: var(--text); border-color: var(--muted); }

  .transcript-body { padding: 0; flex: 1; }
  .transcript-area {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 340px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Courier New', monospace;
    line-height: 1.7;
    resize: vertical;
    outline: none;
  }
  .transcript-area::placeholder { color: var(--muted); opacity: .6; }

  .transcript-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .char-count { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }

  /* Submit */
  .submit-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 11px 28px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #05090f;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: inherit;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    transition: background .15s, box-shadow .15s, transform .1s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .submit-btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(56,189,248,.4), 0 4px 20px rgba(56,189,248,.25);
  }
  .submit-btn:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
</style>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-chip">
    <iconify-icon icon="lucide:zap" width="11" height="11"></iconify-icon>
    AI-Powered Analysis
  </div>
  <h1>Turn meetings into <span>structured insights</span></h1>
  <p>Paste any meeting transcript and extract decisions, action items, open questions and follow-ups — instantly.</p>
</div>

@if(flashMessages.has('error'))
<div class="alert alert-error" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
  <iconify-icon icon="lucide:alert-triangle" width="16" height="16"></iconify-icon>
  <span>{{ flashMessages.get('error') }}</span>
</div>
@end

<form action="/analyze" method="POST">
  {{ csrfField() }}
  <input type="hidden" name="model" value="gemini-3.8-flash" />
  <input type="hidden" name="prompt_version" value="3" />

    <!-- Transcript panel -->
    <div class="transcript-panel">
      <div class="transcript-toolbar">
        <div class="transcript-title">
          <iconify-icon icon="lucide:file-text" width="15" height="15" style="color:var(--accent)"></iconify-icon>
          Meeting Transcript
        </div>
        <div class="toolbar-actions">
          <button type="button" class="tool-btn" onclick="loadSample()">
            <iconify-icon icon="lucide:download" width="12" height="12"></iconify-icon> Load sample
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tool-btn" onclick="clearTranscript()">
            <iconify-icon icon="lucide:x" width="12" height="12"></iconify-icon> Clear
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="transcript-body">
        <textarea
          id="transcript"
          name="transcript"
          class="transcript-area"
          placeholder="Paste your meeting transcript here...

Example:
John: Let's start the Q3 planning meeting.
Sarah: I think we should prioritize the mobile app redesign.
John: Agreed, we'll go with the new design system..."
          oninput="updateCount()"
        ></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="transcript-footer">
        <span class="char-count" id="charCount">0 characters</span>
        <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">
          <iconify-icon icon="lucide:brain" width="16" height="16"></iconify-icon>
          Analyze Meeting
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

</form>

<template id="sample-transcript">Q3 Planning Meeting - August 15, 2024

Attendees: Sarah Chen (PM), James Okafor (Engineering Lead), Priya Sharma (Designer), Tom Walsh (Marketing)

Sarah: Alright everyone, let's kick off the Q3 planning session. We have a lot to get through today.

James: Before we start, I want to flag that our backend infrastructure is under real strain. We saw some 503 errors last week during peak hours.

Sarah: That's critical. Let's decide right now — James, can you own a scaling audit by end of next week?

James: Yes, I'll own that. I'll have a full capacity report by August 22nd.

Priya: I also want to bring up the mobile app redesign. We've been discussing it for two quarters now.

Sarah: We've decided to move forward with the redesign. Priya, please finalize the design mockups by August 25th.

Priya: Absolutely. I'll prioritize high-traffic screens first.

Tom: From a marketing perspective, we need landing pages before the redesign launches. When does engineering need copy?

James: I'll need all copy by September 1st to hit our October launch window.

Tom: I'll get you the copy by September 1st. I own that.

Sarah: Good. What about the API integration with Salesforce? Has that been resolved?

James: Not yet — we're still waiting on their dev team to respond to our questions.

Sarah: That's an open question then. Can someone follow up with Salesforce next week?

Priya: I'll add it to the follow-up list, but James should own the technical follow-up.

James: Agreed, I'll ping their team Monday.

Sarah: Let's also align on our Q3 OKRs. We agreed last month on 20% DAU growth. Are we confident?

Tom: I'm not sure the redesign timeline gives us enough time to see impact in Q3. We should revisit this.

Sarah: Let's park it for now and revisit after Priya's mockups are shared.

Sarah: Wrapping up — main decisions: scaling audit owned by James, redesign approved and design by Priya, copy deadline set for Tom. Action items clear. Let's reconvene next Friday.</template>

<script>
function loadSample() {
  const tpl = document.getElementById('sample-transcript');
  document.getElementById('transcript').value = tpl.innerHTML.trim();
  updateCount();
}
function clearTranscript() {
  document.getElementById('transcript').value = '';
  updateCount();
}
function updateCount() {
  const len = document.getElementById('transcript').value.length;
  document.getElementById('charCount').textContent = len.toLocaleString() + ' characters';
}
</script>
@end
